# Third-party bundles copied out of node_modules by scripts/vendor-scalar.ts.
#
# Not committed on purpose: it is megabytes of minified code that nobody reads in a diff, and
# a committed copy could silently disagree with the version pinned in pnpm-lock.yaml. The
# `dev` and `deploy` scripts regenerate it, so it is always exactly what pnpm installed.
#
# Root's `dist/` already matches this at any depth; the rule is restated here only so the
# reason lives next to the directory it is about.
public/dist/

# `.dev.vars.example` is un-ignored in the ROOT .gitignore, beside the `.dev.vars.*` rule it
# has to override — one place, so a second app adding one does not have to rediscover this.
